23..24 error[strict] strict mode: parameter `b` has no type. How the function uses it does not determine one, so any value is accepted unchecked. Annotate it, as in `b: TYPE`
26..42 error[strict] strict mode: this expression has an undetermined type (`Unknown`)
71..76 error[strict] strict mode: this expression has an undetermined type (`Unknown`)

